#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:2
msgid "Create Your First Session"
msgstr "创建你的第一个会话"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:4
msgid ""
"Open Studio and add a workspace from the workspace switcher. Choose the "
"project directory you want the agent to work in."
msgstr "打开 Studio，并通过工作区切换器添加工作区。选择你希望 agent 在其中工作的项目目录。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:6
msgid "Create a new session."
msgstr "创建一个新会话。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:7
msgid ""
"Select a configured provider and model in the composer. The model menu is"
" populated at runtime from the backend and shows capability badges when "
"the provider reports them."
msgstr "在 Composer 中选择已配置的供应商和模型。模型菜单会在运行时从后端获取；当供应商提供能力信息时，菜单会显示相应的能力标记。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:10
msgid ""
"Select a mode. Use **Ask** for an explanation, **Agent** for a bounded "
"task that may use tools, **Plan** for a proposed sequence of work, or "
"**Goal** for a longer-running objective. See :doc:`../agent/modes`."
msgstr "选择一种模式。需要解释时使用 **Ask**，需要 agent 使用工具完成范围明确的任务时使用 **Agent**，需要先查看工作步骤时使用 **Plan**，需要处理持续时间较长的目标时使用 **Goal**。请参阅 :doc:`../agent/modes`。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:13
msgid ""
"Describe one outcome in plain language. Mention the relevant scene, "
"script, test command, or constraint when you know it."
msgstr "用自然语言描述一个结果。知道相关场景、脚本、测试命令或约束条件时，请一并说明。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:15
msgid ""
"Add context only if the task needs it. You can attach files, folders, or "
"images from the composer."
msgstr "仅在任务需要时添加上下文。你可以从 Composer 附加文件、文件夹或图像。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:17
msgid ""
"Send the request and watch the timeline. Review tool inputs, proposed "
"changes, terminal output, and verification status before continuing."
msgstr "发送请求并观察时间线。继续操作前，请审查工具输入、提议的变更、终端输出和验证状态。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:21
msgid "A good first request"
msgstr "一个好的首次请求"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:23
msgid "Prefer a request with a visible acceptance condition, for example::"
msgstr "优先使用带有明确验收条件的请求，例如："

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:29
msgid ""
"This gives the agent a target, a safety constraint, and a way to verify "
"the result. If you already know that a file should change, name the file "
"and say what behavior should be different."
msgstr "这样可以为 agent 提供目标、安全约束以及验证结果的方法。如果你已经知道应该修改哪个文件，请写出文件名，并说明行为应如何变化。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:34
msgid "If the agent needs more information"
msgstr "如果 agent 需要更多信息"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:36
msgid ""
"The composer can show a context-budget estimate and the session can keep "
"attachments and plans. Prefer a small, relevant selection over attaching "
"the whole repository. You can ask the agent to inspect the workspace "
"first and then attach the files it identifies as relevant."
msgstr "Composer 可以显示上下文预算估算，会话也可以保留附件和计划。相比附加整个仓库，更推荐选择少量且相关的内容。你可以先让 agent 检查工作区，再附加它识别出的相关文件。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-session.rst:41
msgid ""
"When a run finishes, the session remains available in the workspace tree."
" You can continue it, start a fresh session for a separate task, or "
"archive it without losing its history."
msgstr "一次运行结束后，会话仍会保留在工作区树中。你可以继续该会话，为其他任务启动全新会话，或将其归档而不丢失历史记录。"
